Third-party components:

- TTS engine: Kyutai Pocket TTS (https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts),
  MIT License.

- Voice samples in assets/voice_samples/: sourced from
  https://huggingface.co/kyutai/tts-voices
  - LibriVox-derived voices via the voice-zero project: CC0
  - VCTK recordings (Voice Cloning Toolkit, University of Edinburgh): CC BY 4.0
  - Alba MacKenna recordings: CC BY 4.0
  Attribution for CC BY 4.0 samples is provided by this notice.

- The ~200MB model weights are NOT included in this repository; they are
  downloaded automatically on first run.
